### Traer todas las aulas
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms

### ---

### Crear aula
POST http://localhost:3000/newClassrooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aula 101",
  "join_code": "A101",
  "duenio": "Profesor Perez"
}

### ---

### Obtener aula por código (join_code)
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms/code/A101

### ---

### Obtener aula por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms/1

### ---

### Eliminar aula por ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/classrooms/1